<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Learn to break down and salvage advanced components into unstable, experimental laser weaponry.-->
  <VWE_LaserWeapons.description>通过解构重组高级零部件来制作不稳定的实验性激光武器。</VWE_LaserWeapons.description>
  <VWE_LaserWeapons.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the beacon of innovation-->
    <li>subject-&gt;革新的引航灯</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ventured into the unknown by dismantling advanced technology to forge experimental laser weapons-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;为了踏入未知领域，通过拆解高级科技产物来制造实验性激光武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->combined salvaged components with cutting-edge research, creating armaments that blaze with the power of controlled light-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;结合了组装部件和尖端研究，以制造发射激光的武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->illuminating the path to superiority with the brilliance of salvaged laser weaponry-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;以组装激光武器之光照亮前行的道路</li>
  </VWE_LaserWeapons.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: salvaged laser weapons-->
  <VWE_LaserWeapons.label>组装激光武器</VWE_LaserWeapons.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to create advanced laser weapons, the pinnacle of ultratech warfare.-->
  <VWE_UltratechLaserWeapons.description>学习制造先进的激光武器，这是超技术战争的顶峰。</VWE_UltratechLaserWeapons.description>
  <!--EN: ultratech laser weapons-->
  <VWE_UltratechLaserWeapons.label>超高科技激光武器</VWE_UltratechLaserWeapons.label>
